&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will play a critical part in shaping the technical direction of Ivanti’s Android platform and Mobile Device Management products. Your work will influence how enterprise customers securely manage mobile devices, protect data, and deliver productive user experiences at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will serve as a technical authority for Android architecture, guide key platform decisions, and mentor engineering teams as we continue to build secure, scalable, and high-performing mobile solutions for customers around the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
