&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; MDM&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee core financial architecture and data pipelines, driving governance frameworks to guarantee seamless, dependable, and actionable reporting across business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Administration&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee the performance, maintenance, and support strategy for core tools including NetSuite (GL, RevOps, O2C), Coupa (P2P), Navan (T&amp;amp;E), and integration middleware (e.g., Dell Boomi).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Management Lifecycle: Architect and govern NetSuite release management lifecycle by establishing Git/GitHub version control workflows and SuiteCloud Development Framework (SDF) across our different environments.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
