&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Engage deeply with Accounting, FP&amp;amp;A, Procurement, IT, and Legal to translate complex workflows into scalable systems solutions and integrated architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
