&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Stack Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep administrative and functional mastery of NetSuite,&amp;nbsp; with hands-on experience across P2P platforms (e.g., Coupa), travel/expense solutions (e.g., Navan), financial planning solutions (e.g. Pigment) and enterprise middleware (e.g. Boomi).&lt;/li&gt;
