&lt;p&gt;The role requires strong operational skills, attention to detail, a customer-focused approach, and the ability to manage employee transactions accurately and independently within defined processes. The role will also have opportunities to support process improvements, benefits administration, and regional People Operations initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have legal authorization to work in the country where this role is based on the first day of employment. Visa sponsorship is not available for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day People Operations processes including onboarding, employee transfers, job and data changes, leave administration, compensation changes, benefits, and terminations across supported locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process employee transactions accurately and ensure required approvals, documentation, and system updates are completed within defined timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Workday, Greenhouse, Jira, and other People systems to maintain accurate and timely employee data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of contact for routine People Operations queries, supporting employees and managers through email, Slack, Jira, and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Operations, Payroll, People Business Partners, Finance, IT, Workplace, Talent Acquisition, and other teams to support smooth execution of People processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation and localization of People processes across India and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate employee records and support regular data audits and compliance checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a working understanding of applicable employment legislation and statutory requirements, particularly in India, and escalate potential compliance concerns appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support People Operations projects, including process improvements, system enhancements, testing, automation, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify and improve day-to-day processes and contribute ideas to enhance operational efficiency and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the administration of employee benefits across India and APAC, including enrollment, employee queries, vendor coordination, reconciliations, audits, and renewal activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle sensitive and confidential employee information with appropriate discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
