&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage a team of Analysts &amp;amp; Senior Analysts ensuring effective work allocation, timely delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a Subject matter expert &amp;amp; support the team on complex document processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and oversee the team in troubleshooting complex Private Fund statement processing exceptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality reviews and assist the team in modifying incorrectly extracted data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and drive key team performance metrics, including SLA compliance, processing accuracy, and throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary escalation point for operational and data quality issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Machine Learning Operations team to identify and relabel documents for model retraining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage clients, GPs, or Fund Admins on statement data related inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Maintenance Alternatives Data Operations workflow procedures and play-books.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for automation, process optimization, and standardization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to implement new processes and tooling features that improve Alternatives Data processing UX and increase operational workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
