&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re a predictive marketing consulting firm that combines human expertise, AI, proprietary intelligence and deep platform mastery to help marketers anticipate what’s next and maximize ROI. Our 250+ experts deliver predictive marketing solutions that help our 950+ clients anticipate what&#39;s next. If that sounds like you, let&#39;s move confidently forward — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adswerve is looking for a Martech/Data Engineer to support strategic client implementations and optimization initiatives across the Adobe Experience Platform, with a focus on RTCDP, schema modeling, data pipelines and data modeling within AEP.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;You will serve as a trusted advisor to clients, helping them design scalable data models across the AEP ecosystem. The ideal candidate will be able to develop and design data-driven experiences for our clients and work cross-functionally with marketing, IT, and analytics stakeholders to guide architecture decisions, ensure successful deployments, and maximize the value of the AEP ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in discovery sessions, solution design, and roadmap development tailored to the client’s use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect personalized Adobe solutions across the Adobe Experience Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult on audience segmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on SQL and data modeling within AEP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the creation of omnichannel customer journeys leveraging real-time data triggers and decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement data pipelines (batch and streaming) within AEP&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on data ingestion, identity resolution, and real-time profile architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the creation of scalable segmentation strategies for activation across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with data privacy policies and governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with client development teams and solution architects to ensure successful technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support QA, UAT, and troubleshooting across AEP integrations and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver documentation, training materials, and ongoing strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous implementation experience within Digital Analytics (AEP, CJA is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL, Data Modeling, Schema Modeling, pipeline solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or similar web technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Adobe Launch and Adobe Experience Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading client engagements from discovery to deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with APIs, JavaScript, and web technologies relevant to platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team of 250+ employees is spread out across 26 states and six countries. We keep everyone connected remotely with a team-oriented culture where everyone contributes and feels valued for their skills and unique perspectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you want to work alongside the best and brightest analytics minds, we’d love to hear from you. You can get hands-on with the latest ad tech, work with exciting clients and pave the way for new industry processes and advancements. All while working for a company that prioritizes your work-life balance. Plus, we offer full-time Adswerve employees benefits you’ll love:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, Medical &amp;amp; Family Wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life, Accident and Travel Protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Allowances &amp;amp; Retirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off and Paid Vacation Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, 100% Remote!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Summer Fridays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Work From Home Light” days between Christmas and New Year’s Day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Referral Bonus Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adswerve is an Equal Opportunity and E-Verify Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, marital status, religion, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, gender identity, gender expression, results of genetic testing, service in the military, or on any other basis that would be in violation of any applicable federal, state, or local law. Adswerve will provide the Social Security Administration (SSA) and, if necessary, the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) with information from each new employee&#39;s Form I-9 to confirm work authorization.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require assistance with your application, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@adswerve.com&quot;&gt;careers@adswerve.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;We are not utilizing external 3rd party recruitment agencies for this search. Should those needs change, we will seek your assistance directly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Agoda&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Agoda, we bridge the world through travel. Our story began in 2005, when two lifelong friends and entrepreneurs, driven by their passion for travel, launched Agoda to make it easier for everyone to explore the world.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are part of Booking Holdings [NASDAQ: BKNG], with a diverse team of over 7,000 people from 90 countries, working together in offices around the globe. Every day, we connect people to destinations and experiences, with our great deals across our millions of hotels and holiday properties, flights, and experiences worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No two days are the same at Agoda. Data and technology are at the heart of our culture, fueling our curiosity and innovation. If you’re ready to begin your best journey and help build travel for the world, join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Contract extension possible based on performance, with additional benefits including a performance bonus and medical insurance*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about engineering automation solutions that improve efficiency, accuracy, and control at scale? Do you thrive in a fast-paced, data-driven environment? Agoda’s Finance Operations Excellence is seeking a VBA Automation Specialist to serve as a hands-on technical expert focused on designing, developing, and maintaining automation solutions for finance operations. You will play a key role in building robust tools and workflow automations, modernizing manual processes, and enabling a more scalable and controlled operating model across Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Architecture &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, test, deploy, and maintain automation solutions using Advanced Excel, Macro/VBA, MS Access, SQL, Power Automate, FloQast, and Power Apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reliable, scalable, and well-structured solutions with a strong focus on maintainability, performance, control, and user usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance Operations Solution Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance operations teams to understand process requirements, identify technical solution options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer automations for high-volume and control-sensitive workflows across areas such as reconciliations, reporting, validation, close activities, and operational tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Processing &amp;amp; Logic Design:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, query logic, input/output structures, and exception-handling routines using Excel, Access, and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize existing tools by improving logic design, reducing processing time, strengthening validation layers, and enhancing auditability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation &amp;amp; Systems Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance workflow-based solutions using Power Automate, FloQast, and Power Apps to reduce manual handoffs, improve process standardization,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support stronger controls and transparency across finance operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Documentation &amp;amp; Change Control:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and maintain high-quality technical documentation including solution design notes, process logic, code commenting, SOPs, testing evidence, version histories, and user guidance to ensure sustainable ownership and supportability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issue Resolution &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot defects, resolve production issues, support enhancement requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to refactor or upgrade existing automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving development standards, documentation quality, and reusability of automation components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel, including complex formulas, structured models, large-volume data handling, and spreadsheet-based solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on expertise in Macro/VBA automation coding, including development of modular, maintainable, and well-documented solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with MS Access and SQL for data storage, query development, data transformation, and reporting support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in workflow automation tools such as Power Automate, FloQast, and Power Apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical ability to convert business requirements into structured, reliable, and supportable automation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of process controls, exception handling, validation design, and documentation practices in an operations environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing automation solutions in Finance operations environments is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python-based automation, Tableau/Power BI, and ERP scripting experience are not a must but good to have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behavioral Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured problem-solving skills with the ability to diagnose issues logically and design practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well organized with strong attention to detail, especially in code structure, testing, versioning, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to work directly with Finance operations end-users to gather requirements, explain solutions, and support adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation discipline and a high standard for supportability, clarity, and technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a hands-on engineering mindset and the ability to independently manage technical deliverables in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, dependable, and comfortable balancing delivery speed with control and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a technical field such as Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, Data Analytics, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in automation development &lt;strong&gt;is required (VBA and Power Automate are required), Good to have (SQL,Tableau, Power BI )&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in developing automations for Finance operations is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a tech or e-commerce environment is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications or training in automation, analytics, systems development, or process improvement are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
