&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;Develop and enhance web frontend features (e.g., React/TypeScript) for analytics and diagnostics experiences embedded in the Anaplan product shell.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Implement and manage CI/CD pipelines for services, jobs, and UI delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
