&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;Write robust tests across UI and backend layers to ensure reliability and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;Use SQL or PySpark to investigate underlying source data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product, data, and platform partners to deliver BI/analytics features in a trusted and usable UI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
