&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and adoption of AI-supported analytics, and help drive new AI-enabled capabilities that enhance renewals execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement initiatives, ensuring consistent implementation of sales programs and process changes across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
