&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Pipeline Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and maintain robust and scalable ETL/ELT pipelines using tools like Informatica, Airflow, and Dataproc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Warehousing:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and manage our data warehouse on Google BigQuery, ensuring data is accurate, available, and easily accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Processing:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize Databricks and Python to process and transform large volumes of data efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and manage CI/CD pipelines for data workflows using DevOps best practices and tools like Dataform and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with data scientists, analysts, and business stakeholders to understand their data needs and provide them with high-quality data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling &amp;amp; BI (Optional):&lt;/strong&gt; Develop data models and support BI initiatives by creating dashboards and reports in tools like Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EPM Integration (Optional):&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate data with our Anaplan platform to support connected financial and operational business planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Skills and Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of proven experience in a data engineering role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and extensive experience with Google BigQuery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with big data technologies such as Databricks and Dataproc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ETL/ELT tools like Informatica.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in orchestrating data pipelines with Airflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of DevOps principles and experience with Dataform and GitHub for CI/CD and version control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI visualization tools, particularly Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
