&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Anaplan&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Applications Developer &lt;/strong&gt;and help build next-generation planning applications powering global Supply Chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hands-on Individual Contributor role, you will design, develop, enhance, and support enterprise-scale Anaplan models across Demand Planning, Supply Planning, Inventory Optimization, S&amp;amp;OP, Capacity Planning, Production Planning, and Logistics. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with Product Managers, Solution Architects, and cross-functional engineering teams to deliver scalable, high-performing planning solutions leveraging the latest Anaplan capabilities, including Polaris, Workflow, and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable Anaplan models supporting end-to-end Supply Chain planning processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop modules, lists, line items, actions, imports, exports, processes, dashboards, UX pages, and reports following Anaplan best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable model components with a focus on performance, scalability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into robust Anaplan solutions through close collaboration with Product Managers, Solution Architects, and Supply Chain SMEs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in solution design sessions, model reviews, testing, and production deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize model performance, sparsity, calculation efficiency, and workspace utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply PLANS methodology and Anaplan modeling best practices to ensure enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integrations with enterprise systems using CloudWorks, APIs, Informatica, MuleSoft, or other integration platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure data imports, exports, automated processes, and Workflow capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance existing applications using Polaris, Workflow, AI capabilities, and new platform features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues and implement sustainable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led closely Engineering, Product Management, Professional Services, and Customer Success teams, extensive team management/working with cross functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute technical documentation, implementation assets, and reusable model-building standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery of high-quality, scalable Anaplan models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model performance, maintainability, and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful delivery of application enhancements and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption of engineering standards and modeling best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer and stakeholder satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12 years of enterprise application development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on Anaplan model building and application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering enterprise Supply Chain planning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified &lt;strong&gt;Anaplan Solution Architect &lt;/strong&gt;(Master Anaplanner certification is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-dimensional model design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Hub architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ALM (Application Lifecycle Management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX Page Builder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polaris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CloudWorks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model optimization and performance tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data integrations and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Domain Expertise ( Preferred )&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience implementing one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory Planning &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Operations Planning (S&amp;amp;OP / IBP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Procurement Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribution &amp;amp; Logistics Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in Agile, cross-functional product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Operations Research, Information Systems, or a related discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
