&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Have background working in Manufacturing industry – preferable to have worked directly in a manufacturing company in the past before transitioning to SaaS or Enterprise Software organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
