&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Drive strong engagement through frequent consultant interaction and alignment with key internal stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Support internal operational processes (e.g., feedback tracking, timesheets, compliance) to ensure efficiency without disrupting client-facing responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #374151;&quot;&gt;You’re a people person, capable of providing proactive one-on-one counsel to 50 consultants, promoting a positive and productive work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
