&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Business Administration, Finance, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of experience in channel operations, sales operations, or deal desk support, with at least 1+ years in a lead, supervisory, or senior coordinator role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People management experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience navigating, updating, and maintaining enterprise CRM systems, with a strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written English communication skills, with a proven ability to interact professionally with diverse global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and &lt;strong&gt;Critical Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to manage multiple tasks independently in a fast-paced environment across different time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
