&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working within a global software-as-a-service (SaaS) or enterprise software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of channel programs, structures, and partner portal management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with enterprise expense and travel platforms (e.g., Concur) and reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value experience with enterprise platforms such as &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, as these skills translate well into our &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise-Grade Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
