&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As enterprises accelerate digital transformation, identity security has become the frontline of platform trust. This role exists because Appian is scaling its authentication and authorization capabilities to meet zero trust demands from the world&#39;s most security-conscious organizations. You will shape how the platform handles federated identity, modern protocols, and seamless user experiences in highly regulated environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the end-to-end IAM product roadmap, defining priorities that balance enterprise security requirements with developer and end-user experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Engineering to evaluate, design, and enhance authentication and authorization capabilities including native authentication and support for SAML, OIDC, OAuth 2.0, SCIM, and federated identity frameworks&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execute discovery and requirements gathering with enterprise customers to understand identity provider integrations, compliance needs, and zero trust adoption patterns&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architect product specifications and user stories that translate complex identity protocols into intuitive, scalable platform features&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment with Security, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success to deliver authentication features that accelerate enterprise adoption&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze product performance metrics, customer feedback, and competitive positioning to continuously improve IAM capabilities and reduce friction in authentication flows&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
