&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based at our Chennai office in DLF Downtown Chennai. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appian was built on a culture of in-person collaboration, which we believe is a key driver of our mission to be the best. Employees hired for this position are expected to be in the office 5 days a week to foster that culture and ensure we continue to thrive through shared ideas and teamwork. We believe being in the office provides more opportunities to come together and celebrate working with the exceptional people across Appian.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
