&lt;li&gt;Take ownership for coordinating project team meetings,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to develop line management responsibilities for junior members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility for Pharmacovigilance and Adverse Event reporting&lt;/li&gt;
