&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the fieldwork agency landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills (adhering to agreed timelines, troubleshooting and communication with internal and external stakeholders)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and working as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
