&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a global life sciences and pharmaceutical organisation within &lt;strong&gt;Inizio Ignite&lt;/strong&gt;, working across two highly specialised divisions—&lt;strong&gt;STEM Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Research Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;. Together, these teams deliver strategic insights, benchmarking, market research, and performance acceleration solutions for global pharmaceutical, biotech, and medtech clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams operating across Europe, North America, Asia and Emerging Markets, and a rapidly growing operations hub in India, we offer the opportunity to work in a dynamic, fast-paced, multinational environment that:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Makes a meaningful impact on human health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Puts people at the centre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrates collaboration, innovation, and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
