&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;l2rpfr&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;39&quot;&gt;Senior STA Engineer – Job Description&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;41&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;41&quot; data-end=&quot;54&quot;&gt;Position:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior STA Engineer&lt;br data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;77&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;77&quot; data-end=&quot;92&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years&lt;br data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;106&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;119&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Ahmedabad&lt;br data-start=&quot;130&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1gkutcd&quot; data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;180&quot;&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;181&quot; data-end=&quot;519&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;202&quot; data-end=&quot;225&quot;&gt;Senior STA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in Static Timing Analysis, timing signoff, and timing closure for complex ASIC/SoC designs. The candidate will own timing analysis activities across the design flow and work closely with RTL, Synthesis, Physical Design, and Signoff teams to resolve complex timing issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;164ueu3&quot; data-start=&quot;521&quot; data-end=&quot;545&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;546&quot; data-end=&quot;1999&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r7x2uk&quot; data-start=&quot;546&quot; data-end=&quot;642&quot;&gt;Own &lt;strong data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;STA and timing signoff&lt;/strong&gt; activities from synthesis through physical design and tape-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;177s0zq&quot; data-start=&quot;643&quot; data-end=&quot;720&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;653&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot;&gt;MCMM/MMMC timing analysis&lt;/strong&gt; across all functional and test modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17vnu9f&quot; data-start=&quot;721&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;Analyze and debug &lt;strong data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;setup, hold, recovery, removal, min/max, and clock-related violations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ai3568&quot; data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;970&quot;&gt;Develop, review, and validate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;848&quot; data-end=&quot;867&quot;&gt;SDC constraints&lt;/strong&gt;, including clocks, generated clocks, I/O delays, false paths, multicycle paths, and timing exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bevsbq&quot; data-start=&quot;971&quot; data-end=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;Perform detailed &lt;strong data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;clock tree and clock timing analysis&lt;/strong&gt;, including skew, latency, uncertainty, jitter, and clock reconvergence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;168a4rc&quot; data-start=&quot;1103&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;timing closure&lt;/strong&gt; in collaboration with RTL, synthesis, physical design, and ECO teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fknoyd&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Analyze critical timing paths and recommend design, synthesis, placement, routing, or ECO solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6uo78c&quot; data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Perform timing analysis considering &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1341&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;OCV/AOCV/POCV, derates, SI/crosstalk, and process-voltage-temperature variations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u8ejn&quot; data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Review timing constraints and methodology to ensure &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;signoff-quality timing analysis&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qzqer7&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;timing ECOs&lt;/strong&gt; and evaluate their impact across multiple corners and modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14jafit&quot; data-start=&quot;1605&quot; data-end=&quot;1713&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Tcl/Python automation&lt;/strong&gt; for STA analysis, report generation, and flow optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2q7pk2&quot; data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Debug complex timing issues and provide technical guidance to junior STA engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
