&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Astera Labs (NASDAQ: ALAB) provides rack-scale AI infrastructure through purpose-built connectivity solutions. By collaborating with hyperscalers and ecosystem partners, Astera Labs enables organizations to unlock the full potential of modern AI. Astera Labs’ Intelligent Connectivity Platform integrates CXL®, Ethernet, NVLink, PCIe®, and UALink™ semiconductor-based technologies with the company’s COSMOS software suite to unify diverse components into cohesive, flexible systems that deliver end-to-end scale-up, and scale-out connectivity. The company’s custom connectivity solutions business complements its standards-based portfolio, enabling customers to deploy tailored architectures to meet their unique infrastructure requirements. Discover more at &lt;a id=&quot;menurhut&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.asteralabs.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.asteralabs.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Silicon Digital Architect - I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P / Subsystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience- &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;20+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;IP/Subsystem Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to define the architecture and technical direction of complex semiconductor IPs and subsystems. The candidate will own architecture definition from requirements through implementation, working closely with SoC, RTL, verification, physical design, firmware, and system teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define architecture for complex &lt;strong&gt;IP blocks and SoC subsystems&lt;/strong&gt; based on product and system requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate system requirements into architecture, specifications, interfaces, and performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define microarchitecture, data paths, control paths, interfaces, clocking, reset, power, and error-handling mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate architectural trade-offs across &lt;strong&gt;performance, power, area, latency, bandwidth, scalability, and complexity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define interfaces and protocols such as &lt;strong&gt;PCIe, UALink, AXI, APB, CHI, or other high-speed/interconnect protocols&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop architecture specifications, block diagrams, interface specifications, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with RTL, verification, physical design, DFT, firmware, and system architecture teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify architectural risks and drive resolution of complex technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review RTL and verification strategies to ensure implementation aligns with architectural intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and mentorship to senior/principal engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architecture reviews and communicate technical decisions to engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in &lt;strong&gt;IP architecture and microarchitecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in ASIC/SoC architecture and microarchitecture is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital design, computer architecture, memory systems, interconnects, and SoC design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-speed interfaces and/or coherent interconnects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;performance modeling, bandwidth, latency, and system-level trade-offs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical communication and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;PCIe, UALink, CXL, Ethernet, CCIX, CHI&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/accelerator, networking, compute, or high-performance SoC architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking IP/subsystems from architecture through silicon production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that creativity and innovation happen more often when teams include diverse ideas, backgrounds, and experiences, and we actively encourage everyone with relevant experience to apply, including people of color, LGBTQ+ and non-binary people, veterans, parents, and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

