&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The candidate will build scalable verification frameworks, automate verification workflows, improve regression infrastructure, and partner with design verification teams to&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;efficient and reusable methodologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
