&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role reports to the Information Security Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC) Senior Director and partners across Product, Technology, Operations, Legal, Compliance, and Business teams to strengthen and mature Bottomline&#39;s information security, risk, and compliance programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
