&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Renewals Executive supports Bottomline’s recurring revenue by coordinating customer renewals end-to-end-triaging inbound requests, preparing renewal quotes, validating contract terms and pricing and ensuring renewals are closed accurately and on time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role partners closely with Customer Success, Sales, Finance, Billing and Sales Operations, and communicates directly with customers and partners to resolve renewal queries, confirm renewal terms, and secure purchase orders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
