&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Position Summary:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Renewals Executive supports Bottomline’s recurring revenue by coordinating customer renewals end-to-end-triaging inbound requests, preparing renewal quotes, validating contract terms and pricing and ensuring renewals are closed accurately and on time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role partners closely with Customer Success, Sales, Finance, Billing and Sales Operations, and communicates directly with customers and partners to resolve renewal queries, confirm renewal terms, and secure purchase orders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Operational Environment:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bottomline’s Renewals Function is transforming to modernize processes, improve data quality, and strengthen forecasting and pricing governance. As not all product lines are yet fully migrated into SFDC, the role operates in a hybrid environment using SFDC plus operational reporting (including Excel). For certain product lines, requests are managed through a case management process. Team members rotate queue coverage, resolve requests, or route them to the right owners, requiring strong prioritization and attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
