&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Azure Architect&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Exp : 10+ yrs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;As an expert in Microsoft Azure architecture, you will take a leading role in shaping enterprise-scale, transformative programmes for our clients. You will operate at the intersection of business strategy and engineering excellence - on varied projects, from modernising the technology estates of financial institutions to designing new cloud-native platforms from the ground up. As a trusted advisor, you will work with senior leaders to define architecture strategies and visions, while delivering Azure-based solutions that drive clear business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Your role will bridge the gap between senior stakeholders and delivery teams, bringing your architectural vision to life through multi-disciplinary teams working at pace. In addition, you will contribute to commercial activity and promote delivery excellence across our Technology and Engineering Practice through mentoring junior talent and thought leadership in the community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;To succeed in this role, you should have proven experience in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Leading solution and enterprise architecture for complex, large-scale Azure initiatives, supported by relevant Microsoft certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Advising senior leadership on cloud strategy, adoption, and development, with demonstrable client influence and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Domain&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;financial&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;similarly&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;regulated&amp;nbsp;industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Designing integrations between Azure estates, other cloud providers, legacy on-premises systems, and third-party services using API-led design, gateways, and BFF patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Designing distributed, zero-trust architectures using Azure services such as AKS, Azure Functions, and Service Bus for microservices and event-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Leading cross-functional technical teams within agile delivery models and modern engineering practices (e.g., SAFe and DevOps).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Applying recognised architecture frameworks and methodologies (e.g., TOGAF, Zachman, Domain-Driven Design, or NIST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;While not mandatory, experience in the following areas is beneficial:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Senior or managerial-level consulting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Holding expert-level Azure credentials or architecture qualifications such as TOGAF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Leading pre-sales, including solution scoping, commercial effort estimation, and the development of formal bid responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Designing enterprise-scale data and AI platforms using Azure-native services such as Synapse, Fabric, and Azure OpenAI Service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Designing landing zones and secure networking topologies, managing group hierarchies, and implementing identity-led security architectures with Active Directory and RBAC policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Designing and launching greenfield cloud-native ventures, fintech solutions, or innovative platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
