&lt;h1&gt;Job Description: Big Data Engineer – Scala&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Big Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Scala and Apache Spark&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, and optimize scalable data-processing solutions. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with distributed data platforms, large-scale ETL/data pipelines, and big data technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable &lt;strong&gt;Big Data applications and data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-performance data-processing solutions using &lt;strong&gt;Scala and Apache Spark&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize &lt;strong&gt;ETL/ELT pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; for large volumes of structured and unstructured data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Hadoop, HDFS, Hive, Kafka, and Spark SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Spark job &lt;strong&gt;performance tuning and optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable and maintainable data-processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues related to data pipelines and distributed applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data-quality checks, monitoring, and error-handling mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data architects, analysts, business teams, and other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow software engineering best practices, including &lt;strong&gt;Git, code reviews, testing, and CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on programming experience in &lt;strong&gt;Scala&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;Apache Spark / Spark SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Big Data and distributed computing concepts&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Hadoop ecosystem technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, including Hadoop/HDFS and Hive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building large-scale &lt;strong&gt;ETL/data engineering pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; or similar messaging/streaming technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data formats such as &lt;strong&gt;Parquet, Avro, and JSON&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with performance optimization and troubleshooting of Spark applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of software development lifecycle and version-control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Good to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Airflow&lt;/strong&gt; or similar orchestration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Delta Lake&lt;/strong&gt; or other modern lakehouse technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile/Scrum environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Core Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scala | Apache Spark | Spark SQL | SQL | Hadoop | HDFS | Hive | Kafka | ETL | Data Engineering | Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

