&lt;p&gt;Business Analyst – Payments Domain&lt;br&gt;Experience&lt;br&gt;• 6–10 years of overall experience, with at least 4+ Years of relevant hands-on experience in the Payments domain. &lt;br&gt;• Proven experience as a Business Analyst in payments implementation and transformation programs. &lt;br&gt;• Candidates must have direct Payments domain experience. Profiles with only adjacent banking or financial &lt;br&gt;services experience, without hands-on Payments expertise, will not be considered.&lt;br&gt;Mandatory Skills&lt;br&gt;1. Payments Domain Expertise&lt;br&gt;• Strong Subject Matter Expert (SME) in the Payments Domain with a deep understanding of end-to-end payment &lt;br&gt;processing, payment lifecycle, and payment operations. &lt;br&gt;• Broad Payments domain experience beyond MT-to-MX migration projects, with exposure to Payment Hub &lt;br&gt;modernization, clearing integration, and payment processing initiatives. &lt;br&gt;2. Payment Hub &amp;amp; System Integration&lt;br&gt;• Hands-on experience with Payment Hub/Payment Orchestration platforms, including integration with upstream &lt;br&gt;and downstream banking/payment systems. &lt;br&gt;• Strong understanding of payment system integrations, API/service-based architectures, message &lt;br&gt;routing/orchestration, and collaboration with business, operations, product, and technology teams throughout &lt;br&gt;the implementation lifecycle. &lt;br&gt;3. Payment Messaging Standards&lt;br&gt;• Strong knowledge of payment messaging standards, including ISO 20022 (MX) and SWIFT MT message formats, &lt;br&gt;with experience in message mapping, validation, and transformation. &lt;br&gt;4. Clearing &amp;amp; Payment Rails&lt;br&gt;• Proven experience working with clearing schemes and payment rails such as RTGS, ACH, NACH, UPI, NEFT, &lt;br&gt;FPS, SEPA, or equivalent regional clearing systems. &lt;br&gt;5. Business Analysis &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;br&gt;• Proven experience in requirements gathering, business process analysis, solution design, testing, and &lt;br&gt;stakeholder management for payments implementation and transformation programs. &lt;br&gt;• Experience in defining functional requirements, business rules, message flows, exception handling, &lt;br&gt;reconciliation processes, and integration specifications for payment systems. &lt;br&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;br&gt;• Experience with payment hub products such as Finastra, FIS, Volante, Temenos, Fiserv, ACI, or similar payment &lt;br&gt;processing platforms&lt;/p&gt;
