&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable, reliable, and high-performance data pipelines for batch and real-time data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and optimize &lt;strong&gt;Kafka-based event streaming solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring reliable data ingestion, processing, and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop production-grade data processing applications using &lt;strong&gt;Apache Spark and Scala/PySpark&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Spark workloads through effective partitioning, caching, skew handling, join optimization, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write advanced SQL queries involving complex joins, window functions, data transformations, and query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and troubleshoot ETL/ELT workflows using &lt;strong&gt;Apache NiFi, Apache Airflow, or Azure Data Factory (ADF)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cloud-based data storage solutions such as &lt;strong&gt;Amazon S3, Azure Data Lake Storage (ADLS), and Data Lakes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Python scripts, automation utilities, reusable ETL components, and testing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and support production data pipelines, troubleshoot incidents, perform root cause analysis (RCA), and implement preventive measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end data engineering solutions with a focus on scalability, performance, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct code reviews, enforce engineering best practices, and mentor junior data engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Apache Kafka / Event Streaming&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Kafka architecture, event streaming concepts, and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing and supporting Kafka-based data ingestion and streaming pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Kafka producers, consumers, topics, partitions, consumer groups, and offset management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of fault tolerance, message delivery guarantees, and streaming performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Apache Spark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Apache Spark for large-scale data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Spark performance tuning, including joins, partitioning, caching, data skew handling, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and optimizing production-grade Spark applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Scala / PySpark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one of Scala or PySpark, with working knowledge of the other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write efficient, maintainable, and production-ready code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL skills, including complex joins, window functions, query optimization, and data modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and optimizing SQL performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Data Orchestration – NiFi / Airflow / ADF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in at least one orchestration tool, with working knowledge of the others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently design, develop, monitor, and troubleshoot data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Cloud Storage – S3 / ADLS / Data Lake&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud-based data lakes and storage solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of file formats, partitioning strategies, storage design, data lifecycle management, and performance considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. Python&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good Python scripting and automation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building utilities, ETL components, and automated testing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8. Production Support &amp;amp; Troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling production incidents, monitoring data pipelines, and performing root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to implement resiliency improvements and ensure pipeline stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Additional Expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently design and deliver medium-to-complex data engineering pipelines with minimal guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, debugging, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of data engineering best practices, performance optimization, and scalable architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting code reviews and mentoring junior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum 5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in data engineering, big data technologies, and data pipeline development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Kafka-based streaming solutions and distributed data processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Candidate Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a technically strong, hands-on Senior Data Engineer who can independently own data engineering deliverables, build robust Kafka-based streaming pipelines, optimize large-scale Spark workloads, resolve complex production issues, and contribute to technical design decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are keen to join us, you will be part of an organization that values your contributions, recognizes your potential, and provides ample opportunities for growth. For more information, visit www.capco.com. Follow us on Twitter, Facebook, LinkedIn, and YouTube.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
