&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Executive PMO- Banking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Capco, a Wipro company, is a global technology and management consulting firm. Awarded with &lt;strong&gt;Consultancy of the year in the &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;British Bank Award&lt;/strong&gt; and has been ranked &lt;strong&gt;Top 100 Best Companies for Women in India 2022 by &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://avtarinc.com/what-we-do/enrich-diversity/best-companies-for-women/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avtar &amp;amp; Seramount&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. With our presence across 32 cities across globe, we support 100+ clients across&amp;nbsp;banking, financial and Energy sectors. We are recognized for our deep transformation execution and delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY JOIN CAPCO?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on engaging projects with the largest international and local banks, insurance companies, payment service providers and other key players in the industry. The projects that will transform the financial services industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovative thinking, delivery excellence and thought leadership to help our clients transform their business. Together with our clients and industry partners, we deliver disruptive work that is changing energy and financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#BEYOURSELFATWORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco has a tolerant, open culture that values diversity, inclusivity, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER ADVANCEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With no forced hierarchy at Capco, everyone has the opportunity to grow as we grow, taking their career into their own hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that diversity of people and perspective gives us a competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;headline mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description – Senior PMO / Executive PMO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India (Hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-calibre Senior PMO who can operate as a trusted advisor to programme leadership. This role requires an individual who excels at executive stakeholder engagement, builds world-class Excel-based reporting and dashboards, and confidently drives senior governance forums. The successful candidate will combine analytical rigour with executive presence to provide meaningful insights, influence decision-making, and continuously improve programme governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior business and technology stakeholders, including Directors, Managing Directors, and Executive Sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary PMO interface for programme leadership, ensuring timely communication of programme status, risks, decisions, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stakeholders through data-driven insights and structured recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare executives for governance meetings by developing concise briefing notes and decision papers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Governance &amp;amp; Leadership Forums&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the planning, coordination, and facilitation of Steering Committees, Executive Governance Boards, Programme Reviews, and Leadership Forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-ready governance packs, presentations, and decision logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive governance cadence, ensuring actions, risks, and decisions are tracked to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge programme teams where required to ensure governance standards and delivery commitments are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Reporting &amp;amp; Excel Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain sophisticated Excel dashboards using advanced formulas, Pivot Tables, Power Query, Power Pivot, data modelling, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce executive dashboards that provide meaningful insights into programme health, financials, milestones, risks, dependencies, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform complex datasets into clear, visually compelling reports for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve reporting by introducing automation and reducing manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme Governance &amp;amp; PMO Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage programme plans, RAID logs, milestones, dependencies, and governance artefacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to PMO standards, methodologies, and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support portfolio planning, resource management, budgeting, forecasting, and financial tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate programme documentation and audit-ready governance records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
