&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is within the Design capability for Finance on the cloud under Transformation Family. Requirement Analysis &amp;amp; Design team is a team formed under change delivery and this role is expected to support Finance in the cloud design &amp;amp; implementation work India. The team consist of 30-40 Business analysts who are Design business analyst with techno-functional skills and subject matter experts in Liquidity reporting/ ALCM domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are quarterly/monthly releases planned for the current production system and the Requirement &amp;amp; design team is involved in requirement analysis, functional solution design, requirements translation into deliverables, delivery tracking during the release and support the program/project manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
