&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Accountabilities and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The principal responsibility of the Business Analysis job category is to manage and execute analysis activity for one or more projects, programmes of Liquidity Reporting. The role holder may be in a variety of areas of HSBC, they may be in projects as well as in established BAU teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is possible that the Business Analyst will work on multiple projects, programmes or value streams simultaneously. Primary responsibilities &amp;amp; accountability includes the following-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Lead cloud requirements (L1 &amp;amp; L2- Mandatory regulatory requirement, system enhancements, output requirements)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Work on finding the optimal design solution of the requirements by interacting with different stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ensuring all the requisite project documents (functional designs, L2 solution, technical design, etc) are prepared &amp;amp; maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Involved in the various stages of Change Delivery cycle (design, testing, implementation).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Engage with stakeholders to ensure they understand the design/functionality of the changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Engage with the stakeholders in obtaining the sign off the requisite changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ensure all the project related risks are highlighted to the management on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ensuring agreed design timeline are met as per the deadlines by the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ensure that the project is delivered within budget, time and free from defects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ensure that any risk &amp;amp; issue is escalated as and when required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
