&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Regulatory Monitoring: Track and interpret regulatory developments affecting securities services and custody, including local and international regulations (e.g., SEC, FCA, ESMA, CSDR).&lt;/p&gt;
