&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;You will play a pivotal role in strengthening the security of complex defence programmes, building the foundations that enable teams to deliver secure, resilient applications. You will bring together threat modelling, security architecture, and hands-on engineering, working closely with delivery teams to turn security requirements into practical solutions and influence key design decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;You will help shape reusable security capabilities and guide teams across the application lifecycle, while contributing your expertise to the wider security practice and helping raise security standards across defence environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Build and improve shared security foundations, tools, and patterns that teams can use across applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Help product and engineering teams design, build, and operate secure applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Lead threat-modelling sessions to identify threats, attack paths, and mitigations early in the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Review application and system designs, then give teams clear, actionable security guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Develop secure-by-default patterns for identity and access, data protection, secrets management, logging, and network controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Help integrate security checks into development workflows and support teams in resolving findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Create practical security guidance and reusable components that make secure development easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Work with engineering and programme teams to understand defence requirements and apply them to system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers and promote consistent application security practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Significant experience in security engineering, application security, or a related technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience threat modelling applications or systems and helping teams act on the results.&lt;/li&gt;
