&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Tech Lead – Android + IOS - Vadodara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“Capco, a Wipro company, is a global technology and management consulting firm. Awarded with Consultancy of the year in the&amp;nbsp; British Bank Award and has been ranked Top 100 Best Companies for Women in India 2022 by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://avtarinc.com/what-we-do/enrich-diversity/best-companies-for-women/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Avtar &amp;amp; Seramount&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. With our presence across 32 cities across globe, we support 100+ clients across&amp;nbsp;banking, financial and Energy sectors. We are recognized for our deep transformation execution and delivery.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;WHY JOIN CAPCO?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on engaging projects with the largest international and local banks, insurance companies, payment service providers and other key players in the industry. The projects that will transform the financial services industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovative thinking, delivery excellence and thought leadership to help our clients transform their business. Together with our clients and industry partners, we deliver disruptive work that is changing energy and financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;#BEYOURSELFATWORK&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco has a tolerant, open culture that values diversity, inclusivity, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;CAREER ADVANCEMENT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;With no forced hierarchy at Capco, everyone has the opportunity to grow as we grow, taking their career into their own hands.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;DIVERSITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that diversity of people and perspective gives us a competitive advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Lead – Mobile (Android + iOS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;8+ Years&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Mode:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hybrid (Work from Client Office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Lead – Mobile (Android + iOS)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead the design, development, and delivery of scalable, secure, and high-performance mobile applications. The ideal candidate will have strong hands-on expertise in either Android or iOS, along with a solid understanding of both mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tech Lead will be responsible for driving mobile architecture and technical decisions, establishing engineering best practices, mentoring developers, and working closely with Product, Design, QA, Backend, and other stakeholders to deliver high-quality mobile solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical design, development, and delivery of scalable, high-performance Android and iOS applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own mobile application architecture, technical standards, design patterns, and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership across the complete application lifecycle, from requirement analysis and solution design through development, testing, release, and production support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound technical decisions related to architecture, frameworks, libraries, integrations, performance, scalability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of appropriate architectural patterns such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;MVVM, Clean Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, and other modern mobile architecture practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review technical designs, conduct code reviews, and ensure adherence to coding standards, security practices, and quality guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide Senior and Junior mobile developers through technical coaching, design discussions, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down complex requirements into technical solutions, development tasks, and actionable implementation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, QA, Backend Engineering, DevOps, and other cross-functional teams to ensure successful delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve complex technical issues, performance bottlenecks, application stability problems, and production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and improve mobile development practices around&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;testing, CI/CD, release management, monitoring, and application quality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure mobile applications follow secure coding practices and relevant security and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate new technologies, frameworks, and tools and recommend their adoption where they provide measurable technical or business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support estimation, technical planning, sprint planning, and delivery tracking from a technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture reviews and contribute to the overall technology roadmap for mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
