&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UAT Tester / QA Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: 0-2 Years/ 2-4 Years / 5-8 Years / 9-12 Years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp; Mumbai&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mode: Hybrid, 4 days WFO, EMEA Shift&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Domain: Wealth Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a QA professional with strong &lt;strong&gt;User Acceptance Testing (UAT)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to support business-critical projects. The ideal candidate should be able to understand business requirements, validate end-to-end processes, collaborate with stakeholders, and ensure solutions meet business expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform UAT planning, test case preparation, execution, and defect tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze business requirements and translate them into test scenarios and test cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with business users, product owners, and project stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate end-to-end business processes and user workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Agile/Scrum ceremonies and collaborate with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, report, and support defect resolution activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure successful completion of UAT and sign-off readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;User Acceptance Testing (UAT)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good domain/business process understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret business requirements and validate business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Selenium or Playwright&lt;/strong&gt; automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test management and defect tracking tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Banking, Financial Services, or Insurance domain experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
