&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9+ Years&lt;/strong&gt; - Experience leading UAT engagements, managing stakeholders, and driving UAT sign-offs. S&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;hould have worked in Investment banking Domain and have a strong understanding of test automation frameworks and automation patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
