&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Celonis Value Engineering owns the customer value lifecycle — from pre-sales through value realization, expansion, and renewal. In India, VE is a strategic pillar of our global go-to-market engine and a growing center of excellence. You will lead a team of accomplished Value Engineers serving global and GCC-based customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manager, Value Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead a team of ~15–20 Value Engineers (spanning experienced ICs and, over time, managers) and own a significant portfolio of business. You will be a role model and coach — raising the bar on excellence, developing world-class talent, and driving end-to-end customer value across acquisition, adoption, expansion, and renewal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with sales and GTM leadership, engage senior customer stakeholders (CIOs, CxOs, and their leadership teams), and help customers ground their Enterprise AI ambitions in the operational reality that Celonis makes visible. The scope is deliberately fluid: strong leaders here can grow into leading other managers or into an industry/domain leadership mandate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to join the core leadership team of a fast-scaling organization at an inflection point. The India VE team is ~30 today with an ambition to grow past 100 — and you will help shape how we build it: the talent, the operating model, and the standard of excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the org.&lt;/strong&gt; Be one of a small group of leaders defining and building India VE scale from ~30 to 100+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive real impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of a customer portfolio with a ~$20M commercial footprint today and a clear mandate to grow it to $50M+ — leading the work that turns Celonis into measurable value for some of the most sophisticated enterprises operating from India. The scale of impact here is defined by the value you unlock, not just the size of the team you lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your career.&lt;/strong&gt; Celonis is a high-growth environment with a wide range of paths — deeper leadership, broader scope, or industry/domain specialization. Strong performers here don&#39;t stay in the same box for long.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and coach a high-performing team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ~15–20 Value Engineers; set a high bar for excellence and coach the team to their ceiling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, develop, and retain top talent; provide continuous feedback, mentorship, and career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embody the Celonis Leadership Principles — Lead with Purpose, Facilitate Greatness, Be Different, Sustainable Performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive customer value end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the value journey across a portfolio — landing, adoption, expansion, and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer strategy into high-impact Process Intelligence use cases and quantified business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an executive sponsor for strategic accounts; host QBRs/EBRs that communicate realized value to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner on growth and commercial outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with sales to progress and close enterprise deals through value creation (a value leader, not a quota-carrying seller).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply value-selling methodology across the journey — discovery, qualification, value assessment, and Proof of Value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct VE, services, and ecosystem resources to deliver durable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ground Enterprise AI in operational reality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong point of view on Enterprise AI and help customers connect AI ambitions to how their business actually runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer AI-enabled ways of working within the VE team to accelerate time-to-value..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dual fluency — technology and business.&lt;/strong&gt; You can hold your own with a CIO&#39;s architects &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; frame value for a CFO. Ideally a strong technical/analytical foundation combined with functional domain depth (e.g., Finance, Supply Chain, or industry expertise). Candidates with only a general-management background often skew domain-strong / tech-light — we&#39;re looking for both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive stakeholder credibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You regularly present to and advise senior executives (CxO / CxO-1), and can earn trust with accomplished, globally-exposed leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-selling and commercial acumen.&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of influencing and closing enterprise business alongside sales — through discovery, value assessment, and PoV — not a quota-carrying sales role. Comfortable owning and growing a significant multi-million-dollar portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership and coaching.&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience building and leading teams, and coaching individuals to high performance and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A point of view on Enterprise AI.&lt;/strong&gt; You think critically about where Enterprise AI is heading and how it changes the way businesses operate and buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain depth.&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in one or more industries or cross-industry functional areas, with the ability to build compelling value roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Typically 15+ years of relevant experience with a strong growth trajectory. A technology-product pedigree (e.g., leading a pre-sales / practice team at an enterprise software company) is a strong advantage. Direct Celonis or process-mining experience is welcome but not required.&lt;/p&gt;
