&lt;li&gt;Experience in US healthcare operations, medical billing, claims, or prior authorization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in healthcare BPO/KPO, payer/provider operations, or contact center environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of HIPAA regulations and patient privacy practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ Yrs in Quality assurance role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills - verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data collection, management and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
