&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience in Sales Operations, Business Operations, Business Development, Revenue Operations, Analytics, or a related analytical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt;, including data management, reporting, and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
