&lt;li&gt;Strong research skills and the ability to quickly learn and synthesize information about companies, markets, and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to present findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with exceptional attention to detail and the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI tools to improve research, analysis, productivity, or business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, curious, and comfortable working independently in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
