&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, people who succeed here are empathetic teammates who are candid, kind, and caring—and embody our core values and principles. We believe that diverse and inclusive teams produce the most impactful work. Cohere is deeply committed to creating a supportive and growth-oriented environment that works for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
