&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical planning, design reviews, backlog refinement, and delivery execution within an agile development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure solutions adhere to security, privacy, regulatory, and compliance requirements while following industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
