&lt;li&gt;Experience in customer-facing roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of information security, privacy, and risk management principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex topics clearly and credibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise customers in a SaaS or technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with common security and compliance frameworks and standards (e.g., SOC 2, ISO 27001, NIST, privacy regulations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused, calm, and confident in high-stakes or ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
