&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) delivers continuous recovery for the AI era. We help organizations stay ready for constant disruption by returning critical data, applications, identities, and AI systems to a clean, trusted state. Our purpose-built recovery solutions span cloud-native and hybrid environments, leveraging AI to enable resilience at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault is seeking a Resilience Operations (ResOps) Lead to join the Risk &amp;amp; Resilience team and help operate and scale our enterprise resilience program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Risk &amp;amp; Resilience, this senior individual contributor will execute and improve Commvault’s ResOps framework across cyber resilience, recovery readiness, critical service resilience, testing, and governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role turns resilience strategy into operational capability by partnering across Security, Engineering, IT and business teams to strengthen service recoverability through planning, testing, measurement, and continuous improvement.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and mature Commvault’s ResOps performance across cyber resilience, recovery readiness, operational resilience, and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain critical service, system, dependency, resilience requirement, and recovery objective inventories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate business impact analyses, resilience assessments, dependency mapping, and recovery planning with business and technology owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and support resilience exercises, tabletop exercises, disaster recovery tests, and cyber recovery validation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track findings, lessons learned, remediation actions, and program improvements from testing, exercises, and operational reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop resilience metrics, dashboards, reports, and leadership-ready updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate resilience governance, including stakeholder engagement, action tracking, reporting, and follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate workflows, improve scalability, and embed resilience practices into operational processes.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Essential Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience in cybersecurity, information systems, risk management, business, engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in operational resilience, cyber resilience, business continuity, disaster recovery, risk management, GRC, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating enterprise resilience, recovery, continuity, or risk management initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cyber resilience, recovery readiness, business continuity, disaster recovery, and operational resilience concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating exercises, workshops, assessments, and cross-functional planning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, stakeholder management, communication, and executive reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS, cloud, cybersecurity, or technology environments preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ISO 22301, NIST CSF, NIST SP 800-34, DORA, or similar frameworks preferred; relevant certifications such as CBCP, CBCI, CRISC, CISA, CISM, CISSP, or ISO 22301 are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operator who drives work from planning through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable influencing technical and non-technical stakeholders without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple priorities independently in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, risk-aware, and focused on measurable resilience outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, credible communicator who turns complex information into practical guidance and leadership-ready updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
