&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–7 years of software development experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming experience in &lt;strong&gt;C++, C#, .NET, Java, Go, or similar technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing and developing &lt;strong&gt;microservices and cloud-native applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;event-driven architectures, distributed systems, and asynchronous processing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable and highly available enterprise or SaaS applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;REST APIs, SDKs, messaging systems, and external platform integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Operating Systems (Windows/Linux), multithreading and concurrency, data structures and algorithms, and networking concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of identity concepts such as &lt;strong&gt;users, groups, roles, policies, permissions, and access controls&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with debugging and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in Agile development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security, SaaS, and cloud experience strongly preferred.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
