&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development experience with &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Active Directory, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta, AWS IAM, Google identity services&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar identity platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity platform APIs such as &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Graph, Okta APIs, AWS IAM APIs, or Google APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;identity monitoring, change auditing, backup, recovery, or cyber resilience solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of hybrid identity environments spanning on-premises and cloud identity platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of identity security, privileged access, unauthorized changes, and identity-based threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building large-scale &lt;strong&gt;event-driven and distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes, containers, public cloud platforms, and cloud-native technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
