&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) delivers continuous recovery for the AI era. We help organizations stay ready for constant disruption by returning critical data, applications, identities, and AI systems to a clean, trusted state. Our purpose-built recovery solutions span cloud-native and hybrid environments, leveraging AI to enable resilience at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an exciting opportunity to join our Business Technology team. As we move toward an AI-driven delivery model, you will design and build end-to-end workflows that orchestrate ServiceNow, cloud platforms, enterprise systems, and AI agents into autonomous flows that resolve requests from intake through completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate starts with business outcomes and economics—understanding current costs and cycle times, defining target states, and designing the fastest path to achieve them. You will re-engineer processes before automating, determine what can be resolved autonomously versus requiring human intervention, and build the integrations that bring these solutions into production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do… &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orchestrate cross-platform workflows connecting ServiceNow, cloud services, identity systems, and enterprise applications to enable end-to-end request resolution without manual handoffs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build AI-powered request resolution and autonomous operations (intent detection, diagnosis, and resolution), driving deflection before tickets are created&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate AI agents into workflows using MCP, tools, and orchestration patterns to pull context, take action, and escalate appropriately&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re-engineer processes before automating—eliminating unnecessary steps and designing improved workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own automation economics and value realization, including measuring cost and cycle time, modeling improvements, and tracking business impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and configure solutions on ServiceNow (Flow Designer, Integration Hub, scoped apps, catalog, Now Assist) alongside automation beyond the platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop automation outside of ServiceNow using Python and PowerShell for cloud operations, identity management, monitoring, and scheduling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design workflows that balance automation and human oversight—defining approval points, autonomy boundaries, and ensuring systems operate reliably and safely in production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2–4 years of hands-on experience in software engineering, automation, or ServiceNow development, building production-grade solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with ServiceNow development, including workflow automation (Flow Designer), integrations (REST/webhooks), and platform scripting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with authentication (OAuth, bearer tokens) and enterprise data models (e.g., CMDB)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong automation mindset with the ability to identify what should be orchestrated, automated, or eliminated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid engineering fundamentals (APIs, system design, data structures, scripting)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
