&lt;li&gt;Lead, guide, and mentor a geographically dispersed team of IT support professionals, fostering a collaborative and inclusive team culture to ensure a consistent end-user experience and maintain operational excellence in IT Service Management through execution of strategic initiatives that create efficiencies and process optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
