&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, CX Insights (APAC)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our Customer Experience (CX) Insights function across APAC. Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Director of CX Insights &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, this leader will transform customer feedback, operational data, and market insights into actionable recommendations that improve the fan experience and influence business strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible role that sits at the intersection of Customer Experience, Analytics, Product, Content, Marketing, Subscription, and Customer Support. You will be responsible for developing a comprehensive understanding of the APAC customer journey, identifying opportunities to improve satisfaction and loyalty, and championing the voice of the customer throughout the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong analytical expertise, customer obsession, business acumen, and a deep understanding of the APAC market. They are equally comfortable diving into data, presenting executive-level insights, and leading high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Customer Insights Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the CX Insights strategy for the APAC region, ensuring alignment with Crunchyroll&#39;s global customer experience objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a holistic view of the customer journey by integrating feedback, behavioral, operational, and market data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop frameworks to measure customer sentiment, loyalty, satisfaction, effort, and retention drivers across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging customer trends, pain points, and opportunities that influence strategic priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Actionable Business Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into compelling narratives and recommendations that influence decision-making across Product, Marketing, Content, Subscription, Commerce, and Customer Support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable mechanisms for surfacing customer insights to stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional and global teams to prioritize initiatives that improve customer satisfaction and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantify the impact of customer experience improvements and track progress against key performance indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Voice of the Customer Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve Voice of the Customer (VoC) programs across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize customer listening strategies, including surveys, feedback programs, support interactions, social insights, and community feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customer feedback is systematically captured, analyzed, and integrated into business planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build World-Class Analytics &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-level dashboards, reporting frameworks, and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage advanced analytical techniques to identify drivers of customer behavior and sentiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Analytics, Data Science, and Research teams to enhance measurement capabilities and predictive insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data quality, governance, and best practices for customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Develop Talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor, and inspire a high-performing team of insights professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of curiosity, accountability, innovation, and customer obsession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear goals, development plans, and career growth opportunities for team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in Customer Experience, Customer Insights, Consumer Research, Analytics, Business Intelligence, Strategy, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Including 3+ years of people leadership experience managing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading customer insights programs within a subscription, digital product, streaming, entertainment, technology, or consumer-focused business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI and technology-forward mindset with experience evaluating and adopting innovative tools and methodologies to improve the speed, scale, and quality of customer insight generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capabilities with experience working across large datasets and customer feedback ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Voice of the Customer methodologies, customer satisfaction measurement, and customer journey analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior leaders and drive cross-functional alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, storytelling, and executive presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with streaming, media, entertainment, gaming, or fan-driven consumer businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer feedback platforms, survey tools, CRM systems, and modern BI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of advanced analytics, predictive modeling, experimentation, or customer segmentation methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in Your First Year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as the leading voice of the APAC customer within Crunchyroll.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships with regional and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the maturity of our Voice of the Customer and CX measurement programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver insights that directly influence customer experience improvements and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a scalable framework for understanding and communicating the evolving needs of anime fans across Asia-Pacific.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy the following benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in class medical, dental, and vision private insurance healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to counseling &amp;amp; mental health sessions 24/7 through our Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
