&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the role of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer, Shop (eCommerce)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will report to the Fan Experiences Engineering Organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are considering applicants for the location of Hyderabad, India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is looking for a Staff Software Engineer to join our India Engineering Center and help build the next generation of our member-focused eCommerce platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The eCommerce platform is designed to create an exclusive experience for Crunchyroll members, including access to unique products and limited drops. An integral part of the member experience, the platform must be designed to deliver high-quality features, operate reliably at scale, and delight our fans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer, you will provide technical leadership across the Shop team, helping define the architecture, engineering strategy, and execution approach for critical eCommerce capabilities. You will remain hands-on while operating with a broad perspective: solving complex technical problems, shaping durable platform investments, raising engineering standards, and enabling other engineers to deliver with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Engineering Managers, Product, Program Management, and other Engineering verticals to align on requirements, priorities, technical trade-offs, and dependencies. You will help turn ambiguous problems into clear technical direction and scalable solutions, while ensuring that features are delivered with strong operational ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact individual contributor role for someone who can connect customer and business outcomes to pragmatic technical decisions, influence across team and organizational boundaries, and establish patterns that improve the quality, reliability, and velocity of the Shop platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We get excited about candidates, like you, because...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience building and operating cloud-native software, distributed systems, or consumer-facing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience providing staff-level technical leadership across multiple engineers, teams, or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and evolving technical strategy and architecture for platforms with meaningful scale, reliability, security, and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS-based eCommerce platforms, with Salesforce Commerce Cloud preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with backend services, APIs, microservices, databases, distributed systems, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud and the practices required to build scalable, reliable, and secure systems, particularly infrastructure related to consumer-facing services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems for transactional correctness, data integrity, observability, and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities, with the ability to navigate ambiguity, evaluate trade-offs, and define pragmatic technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of mentoring engineers, influencing technical decisions, and improving engineering practices across team boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in an agile and collaborative environment, where your insights and expertise will help create technical solutions loved by our fans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal, written communication, and interpersonal skills, with the ability to effectively collaborate with cross-functional teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The eCommerce team is building and operating a member-focused commerce platform that creates new ways for Crunchyroll fans to engage with the brand. The platform supports differentiated shopping experiences, unique products, and exclusive drops while connecting to broader Crunchyroll capabilities such as membership, identity, payments, entitlements, and customer operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is an opportunity to shape both the platform and the organization behind it: setting a durable technical direction, developing people, raising the bar for engineering excellence, and helping establish eCommerce as a trusted part of the Crunchyroll member experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy the following benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in class medical, dental, and vision private insurance healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to counseling &amp;amp; mental health sessions 24/7 through our Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free premium access to Crunchyroll&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company&#39;s Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;up to 26 weeks for birthing parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;up to 12 weeks for non-birthing parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 Yasumi Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Half-Day Fridays during the summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winter Break&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll ((select from the following job modalities for this role: #LI-Hybrid #LI-remote #LI-onsite))&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&quot;&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href=&quot;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&quot;&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from @crunchyroll.com email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DevRev&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DevRev, we&#39;re building the future of work with &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; – your AI teammate. Unlike traditional tools, &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; unifies all your data sources, tools, and workflows into a single AI-ready platform, giving employees real-time insights, proactive suggestions, and powerful agentic actions. It extends your existing software with AI-native apps and agents that work alongside your teams and customers – updating workflows, coordinating across teams, and eliminating repetitive work. We call this Team Intelligence: human-AI collaboration that breaks down silos, brings people back together, and frees you to solve bigger problems. Backed by Khosla Ventures and Mayfield with $150M+ raised, DevRev is trusted by global companies across industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are an untraditional SaaS revenue organization, built to support a rapidly scaling technology start-up driven by product-led-growth and sales (PLG / PLS). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Specific responsibilities for account executives include nurturing larger named accounts &amp;amp; enterprise customers - who are looking for a better way to connect with their customers and find product market fit. You will work closely with customers end-to-end throughout their lifecycle - from concept to technical requirements, implementation, adoption, expansion, and paid. This is truly an expansive sales responsibility that spans selling, success, and support. Activities related to this role will, for example, include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Expand outreach to existing rolodex and new opportunities, working with BDRs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Relentlessly manage customer followup and your own pipeline, against quotas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with our Growth team to increase product awareness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Nurture and follow up with customers to share relevant use cases, find key decision makers, and gather requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Guide customers through implementation plans to further adoption and drive paid conversion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with our Product and Engineering to share feedback and feature requests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Create content and refine scripts to support the customer journey and engagement points&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintain pipeline data and account information in DevRev&#39;s in-house CRM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BA/BS, or equivalent educational or professional experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to connect with people deeply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Outstanding communication (written and spoken), collaboration, and follow-up skills, with professionalism and friendliness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Named account, customer success, account management, or other related experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Understanding of customer journeys and product-development feedback loops&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Some technical knowledge in cloud-based SaaS implementations and integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-paced, global environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As part of our hiring process, shortlisted candidates will undergo a Background Verification (BGV). By applying, you consent to sharing personal information required for this process. Any offer made will be subject to successful completion of the BGV.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How do we work? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whatever your role, our values describe what we ask of each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a bridger&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Look beyond your own role. Ask questions, share context and help others get unstuck. That may mean bringing the right people together or picking up a problem that doesn’t necessarily fit neatly into your job description.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Care loudly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want your perspective, not just your agreement. Speak up when something isn’t working or someone needs support. Give honest feedback with respect for the person receiving it. Don’t let an uncomfortable conversation become an unspoken problem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Take responsibility for the result, not just your part in the process. Use AI to move the work forward, not to outsource your judgment. Make the call, check whether it worked and change course when it didn’t. If something goes wrong, own it and help fix it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That’s DevRev!&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;DevRev is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

