&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DevRev&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DevRev, we&#39;re building the future of work with &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; – your AI teammate. Unlike traditional tools, &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; unifies all your data sources, tools, and workflows into a single AI-ready platform, giving employees real-time insights, proactive suggestions, and powerful agentic actions. It extends your existing software with AI-native apps and agents that work alongside your teams and customers – updating workflows, coordinating across teams, and eliminating repetitive work. We call this Team Intelligence: human-AI collaboration that breaks down silos, brings people back together, and frees you to solve bigger problems. Backed by Khosla Ventures and Mayfield with $150M+ raised, DevRev is trusted by global companies across industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed AI Strategist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as the lead technical strategist embedded with our customers. You&#39;ll own the end-to-end design of AI-driven business transformation projects from understanding domain-specific needs to architecting scalable agent-based solutions using DevRev’s platform. This role requires a unique blend of enterprise architecture, AI solutioning, customer empathy, and cross-functional collaboration. You’ll act as the connective tissue between pre-sales, customer success, engineering, and product teams bringing our AI capabilities to life for real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Customer Context&lt;/strong&gt;: Deeply understand customer business domains, systems, and OKRs/KPIs to guide solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect AI Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and document AI-driven workflows, agents, skills, and system integrations that align with customer goals and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Trusted Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;: Build strong partnerships with customer stakeholders as their technical counterpart, delivering confidence in our platform’s capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate &amp;amp; Coordinate&lt;/strong&gt;: Bridge the gap between pre-sales/CS and engineering, ensuring requirements are actionable and outcomes measurable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Reusability&lt;/strong&gt;: Architect modular, scalable solutions that can be extended across customers and verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with Applied AI engineers to oversee solution implementation, ensuring architectural alignment and execution excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Pre-Sales&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with sales engineers and customer teams to scope new opportunities, define technical requirements, and provide input on feasibility and effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: Stay ahead of emerging trends in AI, software integration, and business transformation—and bring that insight to our solution designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Quality &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure all solutions meet performance, security, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;
