&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;: Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency using TypeScript/JavaScript, Python, data structures and algorithms, (Nice to have: Go).&lt;/li&gt;
