&lt;h4&gt;Why This Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will define the data foundation that makes Computer increasingly capable over time. Your work will enable a future where every interaction can benefit from complete, trusted context: Computer can answer with evidence, surface insights at the right moment, automate approved workflows, and help teams build faster on a shared data platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional BI role. It is a chance to build the connective layer between DevRev’s product, customer, and operational data – and the intelligent experiences that turn that data into outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
