&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven track record supporting client relationships, sales pipelines, and regional business development initiatives in India&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;High agency and proactive ownership; ability to manage multiple client and internal priorities for executive leadership without prompting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with experience preparing high-impact client pitch decks and executive briefings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Systems-thinking skills and proficiency in CRM tools (e.g., Salesforce) and Google Workspace to streamline operational workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong English communication skills (written and verbal) are essential, along with exceptional cross-cultural negotiation and relationship-building abilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A &quot;force multiplier&quot; mindset, naturally anticipating the needs of the Head of India and regional partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;High emotional intelligence and discretion when handling sensitive commercial, partner, and operational data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Special Knowledge (Nice to Have, But Not Required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
