&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Trust, Accuracy &amp;amp; Explainability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own how responses are presented, including structured summaries, citations, and edge case handling. Design for traceability, uncertainty indicators, and user confidence in high-stakes environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
