&lt;p&gt;We are hiring Technical Lead for the most data-intensive parts of our platform: Ocean Visibility and/or Order&amp;nbsp;Inventory Visibility (OV/IV). &lt;br&gt;Select which domain you are drawn to, or let us help you pick.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Technical Lead you are the engineering owner of your team’s delivery. You are accountable for what ships, when&amp;nbsp;it ships and how well it is built. You set the technical direction, you hold the bar on engineering practices, and you&amp;nbsp;stay hands-on in the code — typically 40–60% of your week.&amp;nbsp;This is explicitly not a people management role. You will not own headcount, performance reviews, compensation or&amp;nbsp;career ladders — your Engineering Manager does. You own the technical and delivery outcome of the team, and the&amp;nbsp;Engineering Manager owns the people. You operate&lt;/p&gt;
