&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years building and operating production software, including 2+ years as a tech lead, staff engineer or&amp;nbsp;equivalent leading a team’s technical delivery.&lt;br&gt;• Deep backend expertise in Java (Spring Boot) and/or Go, with strong fundamentals in distributed systems and&amp;nbsp;object-oriented design.&lt;br&gt;• Hands-on experience designing microservices and event-driven systems — Kafka or similar — including&amp;nbsp;idempotency, ordering, replay and failure handling.&lt;br&gt;• Strong data modelling and SQL skills on PostgreSQL (or equivalent), plus practical experience with caching (Redis)&amp;nbsp;and query/performance tuning at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Production experience on AWS with containerised deployments, CI/CD and modern observability tooling.&lt;br&gt;• A track record of shipping complex, multi-quarter work on time — and of being the person who found the risk&amp;nbsp;early.&lt;br&gt;• Demonstrated ability to lift a team’s engineering practices, not just your own output, through standards, review&amp;nbsp;and mentorship.&lt;br&gt;• Excellent written and verbal communication — you can write a design doc an executive and a junior engineer&amp;nbsp;both understand.&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable with influence rather than authority: you get the team to a better answer without owning anyone’s&amp;nbsp;performance review.&lt;br&gt;• Fluent in Agile delivery and the tooling around it (Jira, Confluence, Git branching and rebasing).&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable working with a distributed US–India team and with customers directly.&lt;/p&gt;
