&lt;p&gt;The role requires someone who is comfortable moving quickly in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and can flex across topics as priorities shift. It also requires AI fluency: you will be expected to use AI tools to accelerate your output and deepen your analysis. You will partner closely with FP&amp;amp;A colleagues, Controllers, and business and corporate-function teams across Galaxy and will require seamless remote collaboration with teammates.&lt;/p&gt;
