&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Senior and Staff SDETs to embed across our product teams and raise the bar for quality engineering at Galaxy. You&#39;ll work on systems that move real value — crypto and fiat&amp;nbsp; across institutional-grade platforms. The problems are complex, the stakes are high, and the teams are small enough that your work will have outsized impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a &quot;write tests and throw them over the wall&quot; role. You&#39;ll shape how your team thinks about quality — designing automation strategies, influencing architecture for testability, and driving reliability across the stack. Depending on your strengths and interests, you&#39;ll be placed on one of our product teams: Lending, Trading, Operations, Custody, Settlement, Staking, Derivatives, or Retail (mobile apps on Android and iOS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for excellent engineers first — we&#39;ll find the right seat together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain test automation frameworks and suites for APIs, backend services, web and mobile UI (Android/iOS), and blockchain-integrated components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the quality strategy for your product team — test planning, coverage analysis, risk assessment, and release readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with developers, DevOps, and product managers to shift quality left and influence system design for testability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze test results, production incidents, and system behavior to identify patterns and drive systemic improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain CI/CD-integrated test pipelines that give teams fast, reliable feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-assisted development tools to accelerate test creation, code analysis, and automation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to performance testing, security validation, and observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other engineers on testing practices, code quality, and automation design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Additionally at Staff level:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for quality engineering across multiple teams or domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-team alignment on testing standards, frameworks, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-impact quality problems before they&#39;re obvious and build consensus around solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in quality engineering or software development in test, with meaningful ownership of automation strategy and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python (primary) or similar (JavaScript, Java, Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and maintaining automation frameworks (e.g., Pytest, Robot Framework, Selenium, Playwright, Postman/Newman).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of API testing, microservices architectures, and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git, GitHub workflows, CI/CD tools (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, CircleCI), and issue tracking (JIRA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and analytical skills — comfortable with logs, metrics, and traces (Datadog, Grafana, Prometheus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile environments with close collaboration across engineering and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, proactive communication — you surface risks, share context, and keep people aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted development tools (e.g., LLM-based coding assistants) to accelerate engineering work, with an eagerness to push those practices further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial services, fintech, or digital assets / crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with blockchain APIs, wallets, smart contracts, or on-chain data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Web3 testing tools (Hardhat, Brownie, Foundry).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Docker, Kubernetes, and cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of contract testing (Pact), test data management, or service virtualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance or security testing experience (Locust, k6, OWASP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of mentoring engineers and raising team capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, testing, or working with AI agents and agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
