&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in back-end development, with at least 2 years in a senior role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on development experience in Node, Express, TypeScript and related frameworks like Nest.js to build REST API&#39;s and other services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with SQL and some exposure to NoSQL is nice to have.&lt;/li&gt;
