&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing and implementing integrations using REST and SOAP APIs, authentication patterns, middleware, platform events, or comparable event-driven approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
