 You will concentrate on automated and manual testing of systems in the lab and datacentre. The results will be integrated with data from other teams to provide the complete characterisation solution for the product. For example, a large amount of device testing can be performed by the production test team using high-speed production test equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW142275126 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW142275126 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW142275126 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW142275126 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
