&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A Degree in Electronic/Electrical Engineering, Computer Science or related subject with 3+ years of Industry experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Be highly motivated, a self-starter, and a team player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Excellent problem-solving skills for debugging issues seen and finding root causes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
