&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harbor&lt;/strong&gt; is seeking a skilled and customer-focused &lt;strong&gt;Associate Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; with experience in implementing technology solutions to join our team. This role involves hands-on software implementation, client onboarding, issue resolution, and collaboration with internal teams to deliver high-quality solutions. You’ll play a key role in bridging technical capabilities with business needs while continuously improving our support and implementation processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work Location &amp;amp; Hours: This is a remote/hybrid position in India.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;For the first 3-6 months, employees will align with USA business hours (9am - 5pm EST).&amp;nbsp; Following these first several months, Harbor will adjust the schedule to better fit India hours based on long-term Harbor and client needs.&amp;nbsp; The long-term schedule will be finalized after the first 9 months of employment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
