&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement, configure, and support software solutions based on customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with clients to understand their business processes and recommend suitable configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve application issues efficiently, coordinating with technical teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be open to learning new technologies, such as Salesforce, Litify, Agiloft, Ironclad, Onit, and TeamConnect to support Harbor implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders to ensure clarity and alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a liaison between product, engineering, and customers to advocate for user needs and product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the creation of documentation, training materials, and internal knowledge bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple priorities and maintain clear communication throughout implementation or support lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify areas for process optimization and contribute to continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
