&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver on a learning curriculum for the Operations team that aligns with Instawork’s business objectives and scales with a growing organization; coordinate and administer training&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a comprehensive onboarding program that encourages new team members to provide premier support for Instawork’s customers and internal stakeholders, as well as prepare them for an intensive operational role managing high volume and nuanced customer requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with management to create training plans, develop training modules, and facilitate real-time training for Operations new hires and continuing education for tenured specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the efficacy of new hire onboarding through continuous process planning, execution, and identifying metrics for the Operations learning curriculum&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish methods for measuring and reporting on learner engagement, comprehension, and practical application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consistent visibility through written status and ongoing reporting, summarizing learner developmen&lt;/li&gt;
