&lt;li&gt;6+ months leading remote or diverse teams, preferably in the technology services industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating content for and publishing within a Content or Learning Management System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to utilize different strategies to engage learners through presentation, facilitation and mentorship, as well as use of online and offline training concepts&lt;/li&gt;
