&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated and highly organized Talent Acquisition Intern to join our team at Instawork. In this role, you will get hands-on experience working on end-to-end recruitment, serving as the critical bridge between our hiring teams and prospective candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;If you enjoy speaking with people, thrive in a fast-paced environment, and want to build a strong foundation in human resources and talent acquisition, this opportunity is a great starting point.&lt;/p&gt;
