&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Candidate Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage ongoing follow-ups, gather feedback, and ensure a smooth and positive candidate experience throughout the hiring journey.&lt;/p&gt;
