&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Function: &lt;/strong&gt;Operations – Rig Data Processing &amp;amp; Productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Mode: &lt;/strong&gt;On-site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift: &lt;/strong&gt;9:00 AM to 6:00 PM&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;The Rig / Productivity Team is responsible for ensuring that recorded field data is uploaded, reconciled, validated, and made ready for reuse. The role combines two critical functions: processing SD card data and reviewing recorded videos to determine whether the data is valid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;The team ensures that every uploaded batch is accounted for, SD cards are returned to inventory within the expected turnaround time, and valid-data assessments are completed accurately. No shortcuts in data handling, no unexplained pending work, and no compromise on data quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Rig: Complete the upload-to-return cycle for SD cards, ensuring data is uploaded successfully before cards are formatted and returned to inventory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Productivity: Review recorded videos and accurately determine valid vs. invalid data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain complete visibility of pending work, turnaround time, and any data-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ensure that every batch is processed in the correct sequence and that no data is skipped or misrepresented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. SD Card Data Processing &amp;amp; Upload&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Receive reconciled SD cards from the inventory team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Upload recorded data to the cloud as per the defined process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Verify that uploads are completed successfully before proceeding to formatting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Track uploaded, pending, and failed uploads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Report any corrupt cards, upload failures, or other data-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. SD Card Formatting &amp;amp; Return to Inventory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Format SD cards only after successful upload confirmation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ensure formatted cards are returned to inventory on the same day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain accurate records of cards processed, formatted, and returned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p7&quot;&gt;- Follow the complete upload → format → return sequence without skipping steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Video Review &amp;amp; Valid-Data Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Review recorded videos to determine whether the data is valid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Identify and record valid vs. invalid data accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Track videos checked against pending videos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain valid-data percentages at card and batch level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Escalate unclear or questionable data for further review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Reconciliation, Tracking &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain daily visibility of SD cards and batches across the processing cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p7&quot;&gt;- Track turnaround from reconciled → uploaded → formatted → returned to inventory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain clean and complete Google Sheets trackers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Report pending work, delays, and card/data errors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ensure all uploaded batches are accounted for and their validation status is recorded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Process Discipline &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Follow the defined upload, formatting, and video-review processes consistently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Avoid skipping, rushing, or incorrectly marking data to clear backlogs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Maintain accuracy during repetitive, high-volume video review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ensure that data handling and reporting remain honest and traceable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Basic computer knowledge and familiarity with Google Sheets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Comfortable handling SD cards, card readers, and computer-based data transfers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ability to follow technical processes and checklists accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- High attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Ability to perform repetitive video review without compromising quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Experience in data processing, video review, quality checking, or operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Familiarity with SD cards, file transfers, cloud uploads, or basic hardware handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Experience working with trackers, batch processing, or data validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Process-driven: Follows the correct sequence every time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Detail-oriented: Can distinguish valid and invalid data accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Reliable and consistent: Maintains quality during repetitive work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Honest and accountable: Reports actual progress and valid-data results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;- Organized: Keeps trackers, pending work, and physical cards under control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;100% of reconciled batches uploaded within the defined SLA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;All successfully uploaded SD cards formatted and returned to inventory on the same day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;100% of uploaded batches reviewed for valid data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Accurate valid-data reporting at card and batch level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Timely identification and escalation of corrupt cards, upload failures, and mislabeled data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p7&quot;&gt;Complete and accurate tracking of the upload → return cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 Non-Negotiables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;No SD card is formatted until its upload is confirmed successful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;All formatted SD cards must be returned to inventory on the same day — cards must not be held unnecessarily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Valid-data assessment must be done honestly — no inflating numbers or skipping checks to clear backlog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;On-site at the inventory hub, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Works closely with the Inventory and QC teams to ensure smooth movement of SD cards and accurate data processing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;Requires disciplined handling of repetitive, high-volume work with consistent attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
