&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At our labor marketplace tech company, we believe that even in the age of AI, the core of success comes down to good people doing honest work. We&#39;re seeking a detail-oriented and automation-savvy Product Operations Analyst to help us optimize our operational processes and ensure data accuracy across our platforms. This is a fantastic opportunity to grow your career at the intersection of operations, data, and intelligent automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Enthusiast:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re passionate about eliminating manual work through automation. You&#39;ve built workflows using tools like n8n, Zapier, or Make.com, and you&#39;re always looking for the next process to optimize.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively leverage AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, or other LLMs to enhance your productivity, solve complex problems, and generate insights. You see AI as a powerful co-pilot in your daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven &amp;amp; Analytical:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable diving into databases using SQL, analyzing trends in Excel or Google Sheets, and creating dashboards to visualize operational metrics. You use data to drive decisions and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Tinkerer:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy building solutions using no-code/low-code platforms like Replit, Retool, or similar tools. You&#39;re not afraid to write simple scripts or work with APIs to connect systems and automate workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimizer: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a natural instinct for identifying inefficiencies and redesigning processes. You&#39;re organized, detail-oriented, and obsessed with creating scalable, repeatable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Starter &amp;amp; Collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; You can work independently to manage multiple projects while also partnering effectively with cross-functional teams including Biz-Ops, product, sales, and payroll.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Data Quality &amp;amp; Integrity: &lt;/strong&gt;Implement and maintain robust processes for validating and verifying data accuracy, consistency, and completeness across all platforms. Develop and enforce data quality standards that become the foundation of operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Deploy Automation Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement automation workflows using N8n, Zapier, or custom scripts to eliminate repetitive manual tasks. Identify bottlenecks in current processes and create scalable automation solutions that improve team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and other LLMs to automate data processing, generate insights, create documentation, and enhance decision-making. Experiment with new AI capabilities to continuously improve operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage End-to-End Projects: &lt;/strong&gt;Own short-term and long-term operational projects with comprehensive documentation and strict adherence to timelines. Define performance metrics, accuracy benchmarks, and provide proactive updates to stakeholders throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Process Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously identify opportunities to streamline operations through automation, better tooling, and process redesign. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to implement solutions that reduce manual work and improve data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across Functions:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Biz-Ops, product management, engineering, billing ops, and sales teams to understand data requirements and operational needs. Collaborate on initiatives that enhance data accessibility and usability for all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Information Technology, Computer Science, Data Analytics, or a related field is preferred but not required if you have equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; Development Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with Python, JavaScript, or other scripting languages for building custom automation solutions and data processing scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;API &amp;amp; Integration Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with REST APIs, webhooks, and system integrations to connect disparate platforms and automate data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Visualization Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience creating dashboards and reports using Tableau, Power BI, Looker, or similar visualization tools to communicate insights to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working in a fast-paced startup environment where you wore multiple hats and adapted quickly to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
