&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Implement Quality Systems &amp;amp; Methods:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the QMS and apply structured methods (RCA, CAPA, FMEA, 8D, SPC) to address recurring defects, calibration drift, gold-sample injections, and consensus checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
