&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bridge Cross-Functional Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate engineering data requirements into floor-executable QA criteria, report field issues back with evidence, and represent QA in program launches and crisis calls.&lt;/p&gt;
