&lt;p&gt;We trust our team with sensitive information, so all candidates who receive and accept employment offers must complete a background check before joining us.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;Instead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instead&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;gets&amp;nbsp;done.&amp;nbsp;Our&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;agent&amp;nbsp;orchestrates&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;entirety&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;how&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;gets&amp;nbsp;done&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;tax,&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;preparation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;compliance&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;filing&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;advisory.&amp;nbsp;It’s&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;fundamentally&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;way&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;doing&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;work,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;top&amp;nbsp;500&amp;nbsp;firms,&amp;nbsp;Big&amp;nbsp;Four&amp;nbsp;teams,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;corporate&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;departments&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;choosing&amp;nbsp;Instead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What makes us unique: we hold full government approvals with the IRS, 48 states, and all cities to e-file 1040, 1041, 1120, 1120S, and 1065, with 706, 709, 990, 5500, and 2290 coming for tax year 2026. No one else can offer this, and no one else will for years as it takes that long to pass government approvals. This lets us build product experiences that are simply unmatched in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instead&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;backed&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;Conviction,&amp;nbsp;IRIS&amp;nbsp;(the&amp;nbsp;largest&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;provider&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;UK),&amp;nbsp;Skylark,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;many&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;partners&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;customers.&amp;nbsp;Our&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;includes&amp;nbsp;leaders&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;Intuit,&amp;nbsp;Thomson&amp;nbsp;Reuters,&amp;nbsp;Wolters&amp;nbsp;Kluwer,&amp;nbsp;Gusto,&amp;nbsp;PwC,&amp;nbsp;BDO,&amp;nbsp;RSM,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;national&amp;nbsp;publication&amp;nbsp;Accounting&amp;nbsp;Today,&amp;nbsp;twice&amp;nbsp;recognized&amp;nbsp;me&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;one&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;“Top&amp;nbsp;100&amp;nbsp;Most&amp;nbsp;Influential&amp;nbsp;People&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Accounting&amp;nbsp;Profession&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Ones&amp;nbsp;To&amp;nbsp;Watch”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will get the chance to build innovative AI-powered tax software alongside a dynamic team. You&#39;ll work on both our customer-facing product Instead (instead.com) and our backend internal tooling that empowers our teams to build cutting-edge features. This role is at the forefront of leveraging AI to drive innovation across our platform, working on exciting high-value features for our customers. If you&#39;re passionate about working on real production use cases utilizing LLMs and want to contribute to groundbreaking AI applications in a fast-paced environment, you&#39;ll thrive as you help us drive innovation in tax technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;tech&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;get&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;chance&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;utilize:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Front&amp;nbsp;End:&amp;nbsp;Vue,&amp;nbsp;Nuxt,&amp;nbsp;TypeScript,&amp;nbsp;Tailwind&amp;nbsp;CSS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Back&amp;nbsp;End:&amp;nbsp;Go,&amp;nbsp;Docker&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;AWS&amp;nbsp;ECS/Fargate,&amp;nbsp;PostgreSQL&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;AWS&amp;nbsp;RDS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI:&amp;nbsp;Cursor&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;Sonnet&amp;nbsp;3.5,&amp;nbsp;Langchain,&amp;nbsp;Helicone,&amp;nbsp;Gemini,&amp;nbsp;OpenAI&#39;s&amp;nbsp;API&amp;nbsp;utilizing&amp;nbsp;4o&amp;nbsp;(still&amp;nbsp;exploring&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;use&amp;nbsp;cases&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;o1&amp;nbsp;pro)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;any&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;piece&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;tech&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;get&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;hands&amp;nbsp;on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship&amp;nbsp;full-stack&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;features&amp;nbsp;end&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;end&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;live&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;improvements&amp;nbsp;based&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;feedback&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;usage&amp;nbsp;analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;solve&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;bugs&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;full&amp;nbsp;stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;integrate&amp;nbsp;components&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;infrastructure,&amp;nbsp;supporting&amp;nbsp;production-level&amp;nbsp;inference&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;advanced&amp;nbsp;prompt&amp;nbsp;engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;tools&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;enhance&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;productivity&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;capabilities&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Instead&#39;s&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional&amp;nbsp;projects&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;needed&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;US-based&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;full-stack&amp;nbsp;development,&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;web&amp;nbsp;frameworks,&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;systems,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;cloud&amp;nbsp;infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;infrastructure&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;live&amp;nbsp;products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High&amp;nbsp;attention&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast&amp;nbsp;learner&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;enjoys&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced,&amp;nbsp;innovative&amp;nbsp;environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;full-stack&amp;nbsp;projects,&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;AI/ML&amp;nbsp;frameworks&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;prompt&amp;nbsp;engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;programming&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;copilots&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;Cursor,&amp;nbsp;GitHub&amp;nbsp;Copilot,&amp;nbsp;ChatGPT,&amp;nbsp;Claude,&amp;nbsp;Windsurf,&amp;nbsp;etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;technologies&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;current&amp;nbsp;stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;customer-facing&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why&amp;nbsp;join&amp;nbsp;us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;cutting&amp;nbsp;edge&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;stages&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;tech&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;that&#39;s&amp;nbsp;transforming&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;part&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;collaborative,&amp;nbsp;mission-driven&amp;nbsp;team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth&amp;nbsp;opportunities&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;development,&amp;nbsp;compliance,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal&amp;nbsp;Opportunity&amp;nbsp;Employer&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;M/F/D/V&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;business,&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;rely&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;diversity&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;thought&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;goals.&amp;nbsp;To&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;do&amp;nbsp;that,&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;seek&amp;nbsp;talented,&amp;nbsp;qualified&amp;nbsp;employees&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;around&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;world&amp;nbsp;regardless&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;race,&amp;nbsp;color,&amp;nbsp;sex/gender,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;pregnancy,&amp;nbsp;gender&amp;nbsp;identity&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;expression,&amp;nbsp;national&amp;nbsp;origin,&amp;nbsp;religion,&amp;nbsp;sexual&amp;nbsp;orientation,&amp;nbsp;disability,&amp;nbsp;age,&amp;nbsp;marital&amp;nbsp;status,&amp;nbsp;citizen&amp;nbsp;status,&amp;nbsp;veteran&amp;nbsp;status,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;any&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;protected&amp;nbsp;classification&amp;nbsp;under&amp;nbsp;applicable&amp;nbsp;law.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;also&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;reasonable&amp;nbsp;accommodations&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;qualified&amp;nbsp;individuals&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;disabilities&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;sincerely&amp;nbsp;held&amp;nbsp;religious&amp;nbsp;beliefs&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;accordance&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;applicable&amp;nbsp;law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;trust&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;sensitive&amp;nbsp;information,&amp;nbsp;so&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;candidates&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;receive&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;accept&amp;nbsp;employment&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;must&amp;nbsp;complete&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;check&amp;nbsp;before&amp;nbsp;joining&amp;nbsp;us.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Customer Success Engineer to join a dynamic, cross functional team dedicated to driving IonQ&#39;s mission of delivering exceptional experiences for our customers. In this role, you will be a frontline technical resource for users of IonQ&#39;s quantum computers, resolving day to day platform issues, answering technical questions and helping customers get unblocked so they can keep running jobs on our systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity to build a career in quantum computing while developing deep, hands on platform expertise. Customer obsession, curiosity and clear communication matter most here, and you should be excited to learn quantum computing fundamentals on the job and to grow into more senior technical customer facing positions over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will respond to customer support tickets and enquiries, troubleshooting job failures and platform issues using standardised workflows and escalating complex cases to senior Customer Success or Applications colleagues where needed. You will also support the onboarding of new users onto IonQ&#39;s cloud platform, from account setup and platform walkthroughs to early technical questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside this, you will help monitor platform and system status, communicating clear and timely updates to customers during incidents or planned maintenance. You will maintain internal and customer facing documentation, pass customer feedback and common pain points to Product, Engineering and senior Customer Success colleagues, and build your knowledge of IonQ&#39;s hardware, software and quantum computing fundamentals over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontline technical support: resolve support tickets and troubleshoot job failures and platform issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarding assistance: help new users with account setup, platform walkthroughs and early technical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident communication: monitor system status and keep affected customers updated during incidents and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and knowledge base: maintain FAQs and troubleshooting guides based on recurring support themes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and usage monitoring: track job metrics and usage to flag at risk accounts and emerging support trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will hold a bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Physics, Engineering or another related STEM field, or have equivalent practical experience. You will bring 3+ years of experience in technical support, customer support or another technical customer facing role, a basic working knowledge of Python and familiarity with SaaS platforms, REST APIs or ticketing and helpdesk systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain technical concepts clearly to customers with varying levels of expertise. You will take a proactive, detail oriented approach to troubleshooting and be willing to learn quickly in a fast paced, interdisciplinary and international start up environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to quantum computing frameworks or SDKs such as Qiskit, Cirq or PennyLane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Jupyter Notebook, Google Colab or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic proficiency in SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with ticketing systems such as Zendesk or Jira Service Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coursework or personal projects in quantum computing, linear algebra or probability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Customer Success Manager, Business Strategy &amp;amp; Adoption to join a dynamic, cross functional team dedicated to driving IonQ&#39;s mission of delivering exceptional experiences for our customers. In this role, you will own the commercial and strategic side of the customer relationship, ensuring customers unlock the full business value of our quantum platform. You will align our offerings with each customer&#39;s priorities, build the plans and metrics that drive adoption and renewal, and serve as a trusted business advisor as organisations bring quantum computing into their operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a trusted advisor, this position offers a high visibility opportunity to influence and inspire both business and highly technical stakeholders, inside and outside IonQ, ensuring they have the best possible experience on our platform. Customer obsession, commercial acumen and exceptional communication skills are central to success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with global clients who are defining and solving real world challenges using IonQ&#39;s trapped ion quantum computers, acting as their primary business point of contact. You will create a data led model of the customer journey, drive stakeholder alignment on it, and own the creation and successful delivery of lifecycle plans for each customer&#39;s quantum journey.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will set the metrics, health scores and KPIs relevant to each account, using analytics to identify risk early, remove barriers to adoption and minimise churn. You will define new service offerings and packages based on customer feedback and IonQ&#39;s strategic goals, and drive their execution, including renewal and expansion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate with Product Management, Product Marketing, Sales and Engineering to share customer insight on product functionality, documentation and educational material, and to influence roadmaps. Externally, you will represent IonQ on standards bodies, government committees, quantum working groups, industry panels and other relevant forums, using strong programme management skills to keep multiple interconnected initiatives aligned with IonQ&#39;s goals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strategic account ownership: act as the primary business contact for global clients using IonQ&#39;s quantum computers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adoption and lifecycle strategy: build and deliver lifecycle plans for each customer&#39;s quantum journey.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Health, metrics and retention: define KPIs and health scores, and use analytics to reduce churn.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Commercial offer development: shape new service offerings and drive renewal and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Value realisation: turn customer relationships into partnerships that deliver measurable value for the customer and for IonQ.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will bring 7+ years of experience as a leader in customer facing, customer success or account management roles, with a proven track record against performance and commercial targets, including 3+ years creating strategy and success plans and driving adoption, renewal and retention for enterprise or strategic accounts. You will hold a bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent in Business, Machine Learning, Data Science or another STEM field, and be familiar with subscription and renewal business models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will have exceptional executive presentation and communication skills, with the ability to influence audiences from end users to C suite executives. You will be a motivated learner with a strong interest in quantum technology, able to translate technical capability into business value, and comfortable responding to shifting priorities in a fast paced, interdisciplinary and international start up environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with global, strategic or public sector customers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with consultative or advisory practices.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience in quantum computing or another deep tech field such as AI and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience creating business strategies and objectives and implementing them with data driven reporting.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confidence in business discussions across domains such as finance, pharmaceuticals and healthcare, chemistry and operations research.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Customer Success Manager, Quantum Adoption &amp;amp; Technical Enablement to join a dynamic, cross functional team dedicated to driving IonQ&#39;s mission of delivering exceptional experiences for our customers. In this role, you will be IonQ&#39;s primary customer facing technical expert, going hands on with customers to drive real adoption of our trapped ion quantum computers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will bridge deep platform and quantum algorithm expertise with customer empathy, guiding organisations through performance optimisation, circuit design and workflow integration as they build on IonQ&#39;s platform. As a trusted technical advisor, this position offers a high visibility opportunity to influence and inspire highly technical internal and external stakeholders, ensuring they have the best possible experience on our platform. Scientific expertise and hands on credibility, combined with exceptional communication skills, are central to success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will facilitate adoption for major accounts, from translating contract terms into technical provisioning through to leading onboarding and managing day to day technical engagement. You will guide customers on best practice for quantum circuits, applications and workflows, working closely with quantum compiler and system experts, and remove the barriers that stand between a customer and real use of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will also act as the primary internal advocate for the user perspective across Product, Cloud Platform, Data Engineering and Ops, on topics ranging from specific UI and UX design to high level platform architecture. You will collaborate with Product Management, Product Marketing, Sales and Engineering to share technical customer insight on product functionality, documentation and educational material, and help refine term sheet language so customer expectations align with technical capability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Externally, you will represent IonQ on standards bodies, government committees, quantum working groups, industry panels and other relevant forums, leading technical sessions and workshops at industry conferences. The role includes travel to customer sites and conferences, with evening or off hours meetings as needed to support global customers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical onboarding and platform mastery: lead onboarding sessions and manage day to day technical engagement for major accounts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Performance optimisation and circuit design: apply expertise in optimisation, machine learning and chemistry or materials simulation to guide customer circuits, applications and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical support and blocker removal: standardise troubleshooting workflows for job failures, set Customer Success best practice and provide direct, high touch support.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Curriculum and enablement content: create workshops, challenges and curricula, including code, circuits, slides and videos, built around real world industry challenges.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data driven customer health: design and maintain dashboards tracking job metrics, system usage and customer health, and turn usage data into actionable technical intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will hold a Master&#39;s or PhD in Physics, Computer Science, Machine Learning, Operations Research or a related STEM field, with a strong understanding of the physics concepts and mathematical techniques relevant to quantum computing, including linear algebra and probability. You will bring 5+ years of experience in technical customer facing roles or equivalent, with a proven track record of performance and goal achievement, and 3+ years creating customer facing technical content such as training material, success plans, playbooks and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will have working knowledge of Jupyter Notebook, Google Colab or similar platforms, and a proven ability to teach complex topics to diverse audiences, tailoring curricula to customer needs across large lectures, smaller study sessions and one to one mentoring. Demonstrated experience in quantum information science, applications and algorithms is an advantage, as is familiarity with subscription and renewal business models and the ability to hold technical and business discussions across domains such as finance, pharmaceuticals and healthcare, chemistry, computer vision and operations research.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with Python and quantum frameworks such as Qiskit, Cirq, PennyLane, CUDA Q or other quantum computing SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exceptional technical and executive presentation skills, influencing audiences from researchers and end users to C suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In depth knowledge of the strengths and weaknesses of different quantum computing hardware platforms and their hardware and software dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS platforms, REST APIs or HPC systems.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and experience in data science or data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Created in 2000, Ivalua is a leading global provider of cloud-based procurement solutions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPANY OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ivalua we are a global community of exceptional professionals, who believe that digital transformation revolutionises supply chain sustainability and resiliency to unlock the power of supplier collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We achieve this through our leading cloud-based spend management platform that empowers hundreds of the world&#39;s most admired brands to effectively manage all categories of spend and all suppliers to increase profitability, improve ESG (environmental, social, and corporate governance) performance, lower risk, and improve productivity. Driven by our passions and fueled by our shared ambitions, we empower and challenge each other to create meaningful experiences for our colleagues, customers, partners, and communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ivalua.com&quot;&gt;www.ivalua.com&lt;/a&gt;. Follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ivalua&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CONTEXT:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our RUN department, international in scope (EMEA, AMER, APAC) and in full growth, is made up of around fifty experts leveraging IVALUA procurement solutions for our customers post go-live. The team is still growing in order to guarantee the satisfaction of a growing number of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Ivalua, we are currently looking for a Customer Application Engineer. You will be reporting to the RUN Manager of the technical customer support team and you will be responsible for managing the customer relationship on the maintenance of the applications in operational and technical terms. You will own enhancements, Upgrades and Application Performance Tuning Activates. You will be trained and certified on our Buyer application (SaaS Source-to-Pay software package).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO WITH US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management of customer relations on the application&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated contact for the customer administrator of the Ivalua solution on 1 to 5 accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for your customers satisfaction by providing attention and technical expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly meeting (prioritization of requests) and monthly meeting (maintenance report, improvement plan and new subjects) with the customer and the integrator partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow-up, qualification, and prioritization of customer requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise needed in troubleshooting code and SQL issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staying up to date with trends with new syntax, query optimization, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior knowledge of C# .NET &amp;amp; SQL frameworks to best support existing and future Ivalua customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate well with customers and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysis of needs, deviations and customer processes in connection with project engineers, production of costs of requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parameterization of the solution and reduction of specific code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upgrade solution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of the upgrade: generic and specific code (to be reduced), parameters, tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer acceptance and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer support and follow-up of associated anomalies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise in solution and Customer Satisfaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training in new and advanced products. Support for partners and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback to R&amp;amp;D of customer needs and projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Punctual participation in customer specification and configuration workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR PROFILE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
