&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Created in 2000, Ivalua is a leading global provider of cloud-based procurement solutions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ivalua is a enterprise AI Platform for Procurement provider of cloud-based procurement solutions globally. A “Magic Quadrant” leader, Ivalua’s solutions work in a complex global economy. Our innovative Source-to-Pay solutions automate customized workflows to source, contract, request, procure, receive, and pay for goods and services across the enterprise, refining the procurement lifecycle while reducing cost and risk associated with spending on indirect goods, direct goods, and services, and improving supplier collaboration. We seek team members with a global perspective who bring customer-focused enthusiasm and ambition to the table. We are a company of doers, problem solvers, and innovators who work hard and have fun. Our diverse team embodies our core values across all our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ivalua.com&quot;&gt;www.ivalua.com&lt;/a&gt;. Follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ivalua&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CONTEXT:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Solution consulting department, international in scope (EMEA, AMER, APAC) and in full growth, is made up of around seventy experts leveraging IVALUA procurement solutions.&amp;nbsp;The Solution Configurator team supports the global Solution Consulting operation to build product-based solutions that illustrate the full capability of the Ivalua source-to-pay platform, meet customer requirements, and differentiate us from competitors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Ivalua, we are currently looking for a Sr. Solution Configurator to join our fast-growing Solution Configurator team, part of the Centre of Excellence, in Pune, India. Reporting to the Solution Configurator Manager, you will be responsible for ensuring that the platform we use to demo our solutions to customers and prospects is packed with relevant use cases, demo stories, and rich data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do With Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the extensive technical capability and flexibility of the Ivalua platform to help Solution Consultants articulate the value of the Ivalua platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solution Expert in implementing specific use cases across the S2P stream (e.g., Procure to Pay, Sourcing to Contracts, Supplier Relationship Management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery of high-quality solutions based on different requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have the following experience and strengths, this role could be for you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in a technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in SQL, database management, workflow, and ETL configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with procurement processes and procurement software solutions is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI tools and practical experience building, testing, or maintaining in-house AI platforms is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BE/BTech or Masters degree in Computer Engineering, Computer science, or a closely related field or foreign equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&amp;nbsp; and at ease in a multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to listen attentively and communicate effectively with colleagues in different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
